Title:  Album Advice

Seq:    1.8

Level:  3 - Topic

Class:  text

Body:

For each featured artist, I provide a list of albums worthy of your
consideration, along with some explanation of my ratings. These
assessments are based on several factors: the quality of the tracks
contained on each album; the number of tracks included; plus the overall
cohesion of each collection. I only list or provide commentary on albums
that I can recommend to at least some degree.

For each album listed, I supply one of the following three ratings.

-   Essential (5 Stars) --- These are albums that I believe should be
    part of every rock music collection.
-   Recommended (4 Stars) --- While not essential, these are still
    albums unquestionably worth owning.
-   Worthy (3 Stars) --- Albums to consider acquiring for your favorite
    artists, or for a really complete collection.

These are generally albums that I recommend listening to in their entirety. Readers may access/acquire these in whatever manner they might find most convenient.
